name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q1_2025'

question 'When you tap "Add to Favorites" in a music app and the heart icon fills in, what best describes what just happened?'

wrong 'The app changed color randomly to make the page more fun.'
right 'The app responded to your action by updating what you see on the screen.'
wrong 'The app automatically downloaded all your songs to your device.'
wrong 'The app reset to its default settings to load faster.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

